{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-solo-r2--gemma31","runHash":"8223cb10","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-solo-r2--gemma31.70fb05b0.mp3","audioBytes":186096,"durationMs":61915,"runEndMs":37276,"timeMap":[[0,0],[19632,19632],[24214,19632],[33520,28938],[38300,28938],[38650,28943],[39350,28943],[41508,31101],[43008,36876],[43408,37276],[61915,37276]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6046,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared cache."},{"audioMs":6396,"endMs":9990,"runMs":6396,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":10340,"endMs":14913,"runMs":10340,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15263,"endMs":17660,"runMs":15263,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the cache keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":20332,"endMs":23864,"runMs":19632,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 0 opens the cache."},{"audioMs":24214,"endMs":25387,"runMs":19632,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":25737,"endMs":29714,"runMs":21155,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.b","text":"Finding the cache is easy. Coming back is the real test."},{"audioMs":34220,"endMs":38300,"runMs":28938,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 27 steps."},{"audioMs":39350,"endMs":40758,"runMs":28943,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":43408,"endMs":49884,"runMs":37276,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":50234,"endMs":56889,"runMs":37276,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":57239,"endMs":58382,"runMs":37276,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":58732,"endMs":59715,"runMs":37276,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":8}}
